  "body": "Welcome to 44 Rockpool Road, perfectly positioned in the highly sought-after Pacific Heights subdivision. Surrounded by preserved natural bush and native walkways, this brand-new build offers the ultimate blend of modern luxury and peaceful coastal living.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n* Smart Living & Entertaining: The open-plan layout is thoughtfully designed so the lounge area is comfortably distanced from the kitchen. The kitchen opens directly into a dedicated dining space.\r\n* Indoor-Outdoor Flow: Both the lounge and dining areas feature sliding doors that flow seamlessly onto a beautiful kwilla deck.\r\n* Entertainer's Kitchen: The heart of the home boasts a central island and quality Bosch finishes.\r\n* Spacious Family Layout (144m2 approx) : 4 generous bedrooms located upstairs for peace and privacy, with bright and open living spaces downstairs.\r\n* Master Retreat: The master bedroom features a sea view and a full ensuite complete with a relaxing bath.\r\n* Quality Finishes & Comfort: Enjoy the luxury of underfloor heating during the cooler months, along with external cedar cladding for a quality finish.\r\n* Convenience & Security: Features a single garage with internal access and a fully installed alarm system.\r\n* Outdoor Space: Situated on a large corner site (279m2 approx) , partially fenced offering plenty of room for the kids to safely play and explore!\r\n\r\nPrime Location:\r\n* Education: Located near the highly regarded Nukumea Primary School and Orewa College.\r\n* Nature at Your Doorstep: Take a scenic walk through the beautiful Nukumea Reserve right down to Orewa.\r\n* Commuter Friendly: Just minutes away from both north and southbound motorway access.\r\n\r\nDon't miss your chance to secure a high-quality home in a community where nature is preserved.\r\nWith title and CCC still to be completed, you have time to prepare your finances.  If you require earlier occupancy, there is the option to move in under an occupancy agreement until settlement. \r\n\r\nCall or email the agents for more information.  See you at our open homes or call for a private viewing.",
